  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A petroleum fraction having boiling range <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>70</mtext><mo>&#x2212;</mo><msup>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>200</mtext></mrow>\r   <mtext>o</mtext>\r  </msup>\r  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r and containing <math> <mrow> <mtext>6</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>10</mtext></mrow> </math> carbon atoms per molecule is called</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
